# Git Worktree Repository

This repository uses **git worktrees** for managing multiple branches.

## ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Update Your IDE

**DO NOT open this directory in your IDE!**

This base directory contains only git metadata. All actual work happens in the `worktrees/` subdirectories.

### Update Your IDE Path:

**Before:** `/path/to/repo/`
